{"reference":"Matthew 9","book":"Matthew","chapter":9,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Healing and spirits","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Matthew presents Jesus teaching and proclaiming alongside healings and the casting out of demons. These stories are told within ancient understandings of bodily suffering and spirits, so the chapter’s varied accounts belong to a shared picture of Jesus’ public ministry.","verse_refs":["Matthew 9:1-38"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_matthew_009_2b188398f6171e66c49cdfe8"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}